HAI 1.2
CAN HAS STDIO?
BTW ============================================================================
BTW GUDGEON MARITIME AUTONOMY :: RHUMB LINE NAVIGATION AND LOXODROMIC TRACKS
BTW Calculates constant compass heading lines on Mercator projection
BTW ============================================================================

I HAS A DEG2RAD ITZ 0.0174532925

HOW IZ I MERCATOR_LAT_RAD YR LAT_DEG
    I HAS A LAT_R ITZ PRODUKT OF LAT_DEG AN DEG2RAD
    I HAS A HALF_LAT ITZ QUOSHUNT OF LAT_R AN 2.0
    I HAS A TAN_ARG ITZ SUM OF 0.785398163 AN HALF_LAT
    I HAS A VAL ITZ I IZ MATH_TAN YR TAN_ARG MKAY
    FOUND YR VAL
IF U SAY SO

HOW IZ I RHUMB_SAMPLE_001
    I HAS A Y ITZ I IZ MERCATOR_LAT_RAD YR 10.45 MKAY
    FOUND YR Y
IF U SAY SO

